{"format_version":"phpbb-2+-thread","url":"https://reciprocal.systems/phpBB3/viewtopic.php?t=346","id":346,"title":"e-cat explanation from RS2?","path":["Board index","RS2-1: The inanimate, physics, chemistry, astronomy","General Discussion"],"posts":[{"postid":2124,"date":"Fri Oct 10, 2014 8:23 am","content":"A couple of days ago, a second independent third party report about e-cat was made public. <a href=\"http://www.sifferkoll.se/sifferkoll/wp-content/uploads/2014/10/LuganoReportSubmit.pdf\" class=\"postlink\">http://www.sifferkoll.se/sifferkoll/wp- ... Submit.pdf</a> Mainstream science is not able to explain the excess heat and transmutations measured... Could RS2 do this?","signature":"","avatar":"","user":"silvio.caggia","userid":218,"userinfo":[{"key":"Posts","value":"<a href=\"./search.php?author_id=218&amp;sr=posts\">16</a>"},{"key":"Joined","value":"Sun Sep 07, 2014 5:58 pm"}]},{"postid":2125,"date":"Fri Oct 10, 2014 9:29 am","content":"<blockquote class=\"uncited\"><div> Mainstream science is not able to explain the excess heat and transmutations measured... Could RS2 do this?<br> </div></blockquote> The problem is with mainstream sciences misunderstanding of heat. There is <em class=\"text-italics\">no excess heat </em>in the RS (see BPOM, chapters 5, 6 and 7 on heat and thermal relations). It is nothing more than thermal motion in the 2nd unit of motion.<br> <br> Have they noticed the anomalous magnetic effects yet? That is what is behind the transmutations.","signature":"Every dogma has its day...","avatar":"https://reciprocal.systems/phpBB3/download/file.php?avatar=48_1558411655.jpg","user":"bperet","userid":48,"userinfo":[{"key":"Posts","value":"<a href=\"./search.php?author_id=48&amp;sr=posts\">1501</a>"},{"key":"Joined","value":"Thu Jul 22, 2004 1:43 am"},{"key":"Location","value":"7.5.3.84.70.24.606"},{"key":"Contact","value":"<div class=\"dropdown-container dropdown-left\"> <a href=\"#\" class=\"dropdown-trigger\" title=\"Contact bperet\"> <i class=\"icon fa-commenting-o fa-fw icon-lg\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><span class=\"sr-only\">Contact bperet</span> </a> <div class=\"dropdown\"> <div class=\"pointer\"><div class=\"pointer-inner\"></div></div> <div class=\"dropdown-contents contact-icons\"> <div> <a href=\"http://bruceperet.name\" title=\"Website\" class=\"last-cell\"> <span class=\"contact-icon phpbb_website-icon\">Website</span> </a> </div> </div> </div> </div>"}]},{"postid":2126,"date":"Fri Oct 10, 2014 8:31 pm","content":"\"Have they noticed the anomalous magnetic effects yet? That is what is behind the transmutations.\"<br> Which anomalous magnetic effect should they notice? I can ask Rossi if you help me to formulate the right question (note they do no know RS).","signature":"","avatar":"","user":"silvio.caggia","userid":218,"userinfo":[{"key":"Posts","value":"<a href=\"./search.php?author_id=218&amp;sr=posts\">16</a>"},{"key":"Joined","value":"Sun Sep 07, 2014 5:58 pm"}]},{"postid":2127,"date":"Sun Oct 12, 2014 4:35 am","content":"e-cat &amp; magnetic level ionization","signature":"","avatar":"","user":"oreneorg","userid":273,"userinfo":[{"key":"Posts","value":"<a href=\"./search.php?author_id=273&amp;sr=posts\">195</a>"},{"key":"Joined","value":"Thu Sep 22, 2016 12:58 pm"}]},{"postid":2128,"date":"Sun Oct 12, 2014 2:29 pm","content":"<blockquote class=\"uncited\"><div> Which anomalous magnetic effect should they notice?<br> </div></blockquote> When thermal motion moves into the 2nd unit of motion, it is no longer in the space of the reference system, but in <em class=\"text-italics\">equivalent space</em>. As such, the character of thermal motion changes from a linear vibration to a rotational vibration in two dimensions, producing the phenomenon of co-magnetism.<br> <br> Prof. KVK Nehru documents this in detail in his paper, <a href=\"http://reciprocalsystem.org/PDFa/Glimpses%20into%20the%20Structure%20of%20the%20Sun%20%28KVK,%20Nehru%29.pdf\" class=\"postlink\">\"Glimpses Into the Structure of the Sun, Part 1: The Nature of Stellar Matter,\" Sections 2-4</a>. I recommend you read through that part as he details the thermal and magnetic effects.<br> <br> Transmutation events occur when the magnetic ionization level increases (as mentioned by orene.org in previous comment). Since the device generates co-magnetism from thermal energy, this will have some effect on the structure of the atoms in the device.","signature":"Every dogma has its day...","avatar":"https://reciprocal.systems/phpBB3/download/file.php?avatar=48_1558411655.jpg","user":"bperet","userid":48,"userinfo":[{"key":"Posts","value":"<a href=\"./search.php?author_id=48&amp;sr=posts\">1501</a>"},{"key":"Joined","value":"Thu Jul 22, 2004 1:43 am"},{"key":"Location","value":"7.5.3.84.70.24.606"},{"key":"Contact","value":"<div class=\"dropdown-container dropdown-left\"> <a href=\"#\" class=\"dropdown-trigger\" title=\"Contact bperet\"> <i class=\"icon fa-commenting-o fa-fw icon-lg\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><span class=\"sr-only\">Contact bperet</span> </a> <div class=\"dropdown\"> <div class=\"pointer\"><div class=\"pointer-inner\"></div></div> <div class=\"dropdown-contents contact-icons\"> <div> <a href=\"http://bruceperet.name\" title=\"Website\" class=\"last-cell\"> <span class=\"contact-icon phpbb_website-icon\">Website</span> </a> </div> </div> </div> </div>"}]},{"postid":2129,"date":"Fri Oct 17, 2014 3:18 pm","content":"Cold fusion","signature":"","avatar":"","user":"oreneorg","userid":273,"userinfo":[{"key":"Posts","value":"<a href=\"./search.php?author_id=273&amp;sr=posts\">195</a>"},{"key":"Joined","value":"Thu Sep 22, 2016 12:58 pm"}]},{"postid":2130,"date":"Sat Oct 18, 2014 10:55 pm","content":"Hot Cat es capaz de generar <strong class=\"text-strong\">Fuerza Electromotora</strong>","signature":"","avatar":"","user":"oreneorg","userid":273,"userinfo":[{"key":"Posts","value":"<a href=\"./search.php?author_id=273&amp;sr=posts\">195</a>"},{"key":"Joined","value":"Thu Sep 22, 2016 12:58 p